sentences.text:
Let the applicant Kasif involved in Case Crime No.298 of 2022, under Section 363, 366-A, 376-D(A),
120B of I.P.C. and 5(G)/6 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012 Police Station Noorpur, District Bijnor be released on bail on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions;
(i) The applicant shall file an undertaking to the effect that he shall not seek any adjournment on the dates fixed for evidence when the witnesses are present in court.

